--  The error and gamma functions.  erf, erfc and log_gamma are msun's
--  s_erf.c, s_erff.c, e_lgamma_r.c and e_lgammaf_r.c, with the sine and
--  cosine kernels of k_sin.c, k_cos.c, k_sinf.c and k_cosf.c for
--  log_gamma's sin(πx), under Sun's notice in math.ldn.  gamma is this
--  module's own: msun's tgamma is under another licence.

--  For erf and erfc (s_erf.c): on [0, 0.84375] erf(x) = x + x*P/Q in x^2;
--  on [0.84375, 1.25] erf(1+s) = erx + P1(s)/Q1(s), erx = 0.84506291151
--  rounded to 24 bits; on [1.25, 28] erfc(x) = exp(-x*x - 0.5625 +
--  R/S)/x in 1/x^2; beyond, erf is ±(1 - tiny) and erfc tiny*tiny or
--  2 - tiny.
