--  For log_gamma (e_lgamma_r.c): Γ(1+s) = sΓ(s) reduces 0 < x < 8 to
--  [1.5, 2.5]-ish intervals: near the minimum ymin = 1.4616... lgamma(x)
--  = tf + z^2*poly(z), z = x - ymin; on [2, 3] lgamma(2+s) = 0.5*s +
--  s*P(s)/Q(s); for x >= 8 Stirling's series, lgamma(x) ~ (x-0.5)*(log(x)
--  - 1) + w(1/x); and for x < 0 the reflection lgamma(x) = log(π/|x
